1
00:00:01,180 --> 00:00:02,390
All done.

2
00:00:02,910 --> 00:00:06,000
Pitching a tent's harder than I thought.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,200
Hey! Hitoma!

4
00:00:08,590 --> 00:00:11,010
If you're not busy, help me make food!

5
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:14,100
Usami! Don't point knives at people!

6
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:15,310
Shut up!

7
00:00:15,310 --> 00:00:17,340
Get over here or I'll crush you!

8
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:19,010
What? Crush?!

9
00:00:19,010 --> 00:00:21,740
I just heard you say the word "crush."

10
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:26,480
Has Mr. Rei finally admitted 
to having a crush on me?!

11
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:30,520
You're annoying me, Karin,
so you help out with the barbecue, too.

12
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:32,250
What?!

13
00:00:32,970 --> 00:00:35,450
I don't mind, since Mr. Rei's here.

14
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:39,880
Squeak! I can't handle onions!

15
00:00:40,590 --> 00:00:43,040
What do you need me to do?

16
00:00:43,370 --> 00:00:46,330
Tobari, start preparing the mess tin.

17
00:00:47,170 --> 00:00:50,800
Isaki wants to help make rice 
in the mess tin, too!

18
00:02:28,180 --> 00:02:33,150
Episode 8

19
00:02:28,180 --> 00:02:33,150
Episode 8

20
00:02:28,180 --> 00:02:33,150
The Misanthrope and the Magic for Peace and Quiet

21
00:02:28,180 --> 00:02:33,150
The Misanthrope and the Magic for Peace and Quiet

22
00:02:29,790 --> 00:02:31,670
I can still eat more!

23
00:02:32,020 --> 00:02:34,290
Clean up once you're done eating.

24
00:02:34,290 --> 00:02:35,800
That was delicious!

25
00:02:36,050 --> 00:02:38,340
Glad you liked it, Macchan!

26
00:02:38,340 --> 00:02:40,770
Isaki had tons of fun, too!

27
00:02:41,050 --> 00:02:44,080
Mr. Rei, would you care for seconds?

28
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:47,650
Thanks, but I'm too full to eat any more.

29
00:02:47,650 --> 00:02:50,320
No need to hold back, Mr. Rei!

30
00:02:50,320 --> 00:02:56,070
When I serve you rice like this, 
it feels like we're newlyweds...

31
00:02:56,070 --> 00:02:58,040
Oh, what joy!

32
00:02:58,040 --> 00:03:00,450
No, I really can't eat more.

33
00:03:02,180 --> 00:03:04,750
We're not done just yet!

34
00:03:04,750 --> 00:03:09,900
Marshmallows

35
00:03:05,170 --> 00:03:06,310
Ta-da!

36
00:03:06,310 --> 00:03:09,900
Nothing to end a barbecue 
like some marshmallows!

37
00:03:10,390 --> 00:03:13,540
For real? Awesome!

38
00:03:13,540 --> 00:03:14,840
Yeah, let's roast 'em!

39
00:03:15,340 --> 00:03:17,070
I want some, too.

40
00:03:18,860 --> 00:03:21,310
Mr. Hitoma, try a s'more.

41
00:03:21,580 --> 00:03:22,840
S'more?

42
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:25,540
You take a gooey, melted marshmallow,

43
00:03:25,540 --> 00:03:29,440
and put it between some salty crackers 
with chocolate inside.

44
00:03:29,440 --> 00:03:32,940
Whoa, there's no way that's <i>not</i> good!

45
00:03:37,330 --> 00:03:40,710
Mmm! It's so sweet and yummy!

46
00:03:44,610 --> 00:03:45,990
Not gonna have any?

47
00:03:46,330 --> 00:03:47,700
Sensitive tongue.

48
00:03:52,650 --> 00:03:56,140
Karin-rin, can I try 
lifting your boobs up?

49
00:03:56,140 --> 00:03:58,640
Isaki, you sound like a perv.

50
00:03:58,640 --> 00:03:59,740
What?

51
00:03:59,740 --> 00:04:02,500
You don't get hyped 
when you see some huge milkers?

52
00:04:02,500 --> 00:04:04,560
I don't mind at all.

53
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:07,170
Score! Thanks, Karin-rin!

54
00:04:07,590 --> 00:04:09,810
Wanna feel Isaki's up in exchange?

55
00:04:10,210 --> 00:04:11,900
The hell's that about?

56
00:04:11,900 --> 00:04:13,780
Thanks, Isaki!

57
00:04:13,780 --> 00:04:15,440
For what?!

58
00:04:17,710 --> 00:04:19,650
Not gonna get in, Neneko?

59
00:04:19,650 --> 00:04:22,310
No, thanks. Don't like water.

60
00:04:22,310 --> 00:04:25,240
Too bad, it feels great.

61
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:28,130
Hate feeling all soggy.

62
00:04:28,130 --> 00:04:30,490
But you'll still keep us company?

63
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:34,940
Uchami. Let's see who can 
last longer in the sauna.

64
00:04:34,940 --> 00:04:37,490
I won't be part of such a pointless game.

65
00:04:38,430 --> 00:04:42,900
Oh? Is someone scared to lose?

66
00:04:42,900 --> 00:04:44,060
Heh heh.

67
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:48,020
Machi, even your taunts 
are dumb and childish.

68
00:04:58,830 --> 00:05:03,450
A shooting star? Should have made a wish.

69
00:05:03,970 --> 00:05:05,810
Still awake, Mr. Hitoma?

70
00:05:06,700 --> 00:05:08,460
You didn't go to sleep, Haneda?

71
00:05:08,460 --> 00:05:11,620
There was somewhere I wanted to go.

72
00:05:11,620 --> 00:05:12,830
Wanna come along?

73
00:05:16,220 --> 00:05:17,370
A shrine?

74
00:05:19,870 --> 00:05:24,100
You see, this is 
where this school first started.

75
00:05:24,100 --> 00:05:25,010
Started?

76
00:05:25,450 --> 00:05:28,590
At first, Shiro ran 
the school out of this shrine.

77
00:05:28,590 --> 00:05:31,740
Shiro? You mean the principal?

78
00:05:32,110 --> 00:05:33,940
That brings me back.

79
00:05:33,940 --> 00:05:38,780
It all began when a dryad said 
she wanted to become human.

80
00:05:39,150 --> 00:05:44,250
I turned her human without thinking,
and sent her off into the human world.

81
00:05:44,250 --> 00:05:47,030
But it didn't work out very well.

82
00:05:51,010 --> 00:05:54,810
She didn't understand 
how human manners or culture worked.

83
00:05:55,380 --> 00:05:57,420
That's when the idea came to me.

84
00:05:57,990 --> 00:06:03,090
I just needed to prepare them first 
before I turned them human.

85
00:06:03,330 --> 00:06:05,640
That's how the school started.

86
00:06:06,180 --> 00:06:08,910
What happened to that dryad?

87
00:06:08,910 --> 00:06:11,390
She couldn't fit into human society.

88
00:06:11,390 --> 00:06:13,940
But she's still here at our school.

89
00:06:13,940 --> 00:06:15,730
You know the cherry tree?

90
00:06:16,900 --> 00:06:19,090
This is the center of the barrier.

91
00:06:19,460 --> 00:06:22,630
It forms the core of this school.

92
00:06:23,300 --> 00:06:24,530
The core?

93
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:25,660
Yep.

94
00:06:25,660 --> 00:06:30,080
I thought it'd be good 
for you to learn about this place.

95
00:06:30,730 --> 00:06:34,370
As thanks for tagging along, 
let me show you something nice.

96
00:06:45,460 --> 00:06:46,920
Did you make a wish?

97
00:06:48,330 --> 00:06:49,560
A wish.

98
00:06:50,380 --> 00:06:54,100
My wish was for your wish to come true.

99
00:06:58,330 --> 00:07:01,510
<i>I wished I could learn to like humans.</i>

100
00:07:01,510 --> 00:07:03,810
<i>I can't tell anyone 
about such a stupid wish.</i>

101
00:07:08,200 --> 00:07:09,950
Art Room

102
00:07:16,690 --> 00:07:18,460
Kurosawa. What's that?

103
00:07:21,230 --> 00:07:22,780
A self-portrait?

104
00:07:22,780 --> 00:07:23,700
Yes.

105
00:07:24,300 --> 00:07:26,190
Do you like art?

106
00:07:26,710 --> 00:07:27,720
It's fine.

107
00:07:32,610 --> 00:07:33,530
What?

108
00:07:33,530 --> 00:07:36,970
Um, do you like paintings that are black?

109
00:07:36,970 --> 00:07:38,020
They're fine.

110
00:07:39,100 --> 00:07:40,150
I see.

111
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:42,260
Don't like colors.

112
00:07:43,660 --> 00:07:47,570
They deviate from what's normal.

113
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:54,290
What's this? Is that Mr. Hitoma I see?

114
00:07:54,550 --> 00:07:55,940
Mr. Emoto.

115
00:07:56,730 --> 00:07:59,250
Did you come to check in on Kurosawa?

116
00:07:59,250 --> 00:08:00,400
Oh, yes.

117
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:03,550
Mr. Hitoma, ever wanted to try modeling?

118
00:08:03,890 --> 00:08:04,580
Excuse me?

119
00:08:05,010 --> 00:08:09,900
Kurosawa, why don't you try 
having Mr. Hitoma model for you?

120
00:08:11,380 --> 00:08:14,520
He wears black, so sure.

121
00:08:14,750 --> 00:08:16,660
You heard her.

122
00:08:17,150 --> 00:08:22,070
Mr. Hitoma, you'll be our live 
model every Monday from now on.

123
00:08:22,070 --> 00:08:24,590
What?! Just like that?!

124
00:08:24,590 --> 00:08:27,010
Kurosawa's already agreed to it.

125
00:08:27,380 --> 00:08:28,100
Right?

126
00:08:28,100 --> 00:08:28,950
You won't?

127
00:08:35,050 --> 00:08:35,970
Please.

128
00:08:39,010 --> 00:08:41,150
A/V Room

129
00:08:40,040 --> 00:08:41,230
All right.

130
00:08:41,930 --> 00:08:44,520
Let's begin our special training program.

131
00:08:44,950 --> 00:08:47,940
Taught by the director herself...

132
00:08:48,180 --> 00:08:52,610
Today's course will be "Humans 
and Humanoid Species."

133
00:08:52,990 --> 00:08:54,160
Humanoid?

134
00:08:54,160 --> 00:08:55,180
Werewolf

135
00:08:54,160 --> 00:08:59,180
Mermaid

136
00:08:54,540 --> 00:08:59,410
The main examples would be werewolves 
like Isaki and mermaids like Kyoka.

137
00:08:56,260 --> 00:09:03,060
Yuki-onna

138
00:08:59,410 --> 00:09:04,460
Oh, yuki-onna like Yuki 
and crow tengu like the principal as well.

139
00:08:59,770 --> 00:09:04,380
Crow Tengu

140
00:09:04,460 --> 00:09:09,010
You mean species whose original forms 
are close to that of humans?

141
00:09:09,420 --> 00:09:12,720
That's right, Mr. Hitoma. 
You're quick on the uptake.

142
00:09:13,410 --> 00:09:15,320
I have a question I'd like to ask.

143
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,850
Hm? What is it?

144
00:09:16,850 --> 00:09:21,230
Do aliens, inter-dimensional 
sliders, and espers exist?

145
00:09:21,230 --> 00:09:22,140
Sure do.

146
00:09:22,140 --> 00:09:23,270
They do?!

147
00:09:23,700 --> 00:09:26,650
So, why this training all of a sudden?

148
00:09:27,070 --> 00:09:31,700
There's a humanoid species visiting us, 
so I figured you should brush up.

149
00:09:31,940 --> 00:09:34,790
Visiting us? Is it an alien?

150
00:09:34,790 --> 00:09:36,330
Nope, a witch.

151
00:09:36,330 --> 00:09:37,240
A witch?!

152
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:41,140
I wanted to introduce you to said witch. 
Would that be all right?

153
00:09:41,140 --> 00:09:41,660
What?

154
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:44,580
She's Neneko Kurosawa's guardian.

155
00:09:44,870 --> 00:09:45,650
What?!

156
00:09:46,070 --> 00:09:51,500
She can be a bit of a handful, 
but I'm sure you'll be fine.

157
00:09:52,420 --> 00:09:56,340
Director's Office

158
00:09:53,430 --> 00:09:56,340
Long time, no see. How's it been?

159
00:09:56,340 --> 00:09:59,230
Oh, Lady Shiranui!

160
00:09:59,230 --> 00:10:02,640
It's so boring without you around!

161
00:10:02,640 --> 00:10:05,930
You're so wonderfully tiny in this form.

162
00:10:05,930 --> 00:10:08,490
Like an adorable infant.

163
00:10:09,250 --> 00:10:10,900
Thanks.

164
00:10:12,100 --> 00:10:13,820
Is this her homeroom teacher?

165
00:10:13,820 --> 00:10:16,850
That's right. Call him Mr. Hitoma.

166
00:10:16,850 --> 00:10:18,130
Oh?

167
00:10:18,130 --> 00:10:20,370
<i>She's showing zero interest.</i>

168
00:10:20,370 --> 00:10:21,990
Let me introduce you.

169
00:10:21,990 --> 00:10:24,790
This is Alice Medea, her guardian.

170
00:10:25,380 --> 00:10:30,340
Hello. I'm Rei Hitoma, 
Neneko Kurosawa's homeroom teacher.

171
00:10:30,340 --> 00:10:33,930
Did she end up being named Neneko?

172
00:10:33,930 --> 00:10:36,330
You came up with 
a great name, Lady Shiranui.

173
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:38,260
Thanks.

174
00:10:39,410 --> 00:10:45,090
Lady Shiranui, how much longer 
are you going to stay in this dull place?

175
00:10:45,090 --> 00:10:48,190
With these tacky, loud-mouthed tengu.

176
00:10:48,490 --> 00:10:49,400
Pardon?

177
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:53,010
You came to me for advice 
when you started the school,

178
00:10:53,010 --> 00:10:56,860
so I thought you were 
going to stay by my side.

179
00:10:57,140 --> 00:11:00,190
I told you I was going to 
stick around here from the start.

180
00:11:00,190 --> 00:11:04,180
But you really helped me 
out back then, Alice.

181
00:11:04,180 --> 00:11:05,160
Thanks.

182
00:11:06,530 --> 00:11:07,500
I love you!

183
00:11:08,420 --> 00:11:11,500
On what business have you come here again?

184
00:11:11,790 --> 00:11:16,010
What? The biggest reason 
is I wanted to see Lady Shiranui.

185
00:11:16,010 --> 00:11:20,950
And since I'm here, I wanted to ask my
kitty's homeroom teacher how she's doing.

186
00:11:20,950 --> 00:11:22,430
There you have it.

187
00:11:22,430 --> 00:11:25,350
How do you think Neneko's 
doing, Mr. Hitoma?

188
00:11:26,010 --> 00:11:28,110
Kurosawa's doing just fine.

189
00:11:28,570 --> 00:11:31,780
I do warn her about 
falling asleep all the time.

190
00:11:31,780 --> 00:11:34,650
But it hasn't affected her grades, 
which are top of the class.

191
00:11:34,970 --> 00:11:35,850
I see.

192
00:11:35,850 --> 00:11:42,570
It's best that she leave me before long,
so turn her human as soon as you can.

193
00:11:42,570 --> 00:11:44,910
That all depends on Neneko.

194
00:11:44,910 --> 00:11:49,290
Miss Alice, why do you 
want Kurosawa to be human?

195
00:11:49,290 --> 00:11:53,120
I don't know if it's from 
being around me for so long,

196
00:11:53,120 --> 00:11:55,170
but she's started to gain magical power.

197
00:11:55,550 --> 00:11:58,090
Good thing I noticed just 
before it was too late.

198
00:11:58,860 --> 00:12:00,010
Too late?

199
00:12:00,010 --> 00:12:03,140
We can't have her wielding magic,

200
00:12:03,140 --> 00:12:07,200
so I reached out to Lady Shiranui, 
who agreed to take her in.

201
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:09,060
Why can't she wield magic?

202
00:12:09,370 --> 00:12:13,980
If she exceeds a certain level of
magical power, she'll cease to be a cat.

203
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:16,870
I believe you call it 
a nekomata around here?

204
00:12:16,870 --> 00:12:18,070
Nekomata?

205
00:12:18,530 --> 00:12:21,490
It'd be a real hassle if that happened.

206
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:25,590
Nekomata are but shadows 
of their beastly selves.

207
00:12:25,590 --> 00:12:30,680
They can't control their own magic, 
and attack people against their will.

208
00:12:27,310 --> 00:12:33,340
Nekomata

209
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:33,420
Do you think she could live 
with herself like that?

210
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:38,650
Which is why, to ensure her 
magical power stays below the limit,

211
00:12:39,090 --> 00:12:42,750
I figured I could have Lady 
Shiranui turn her into a human.

212
00:12:42,750 --> 00:12:44,720
I can't turn Alice down.

213
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:47,850
Neneko agreed to as well, 
so I let her enroll.

214
00:12:48,370 --> 00:12:50,820
Kurosawa agreed to it?

215
00:12:50,820 --> 00:12:54,210
What's more, as long 
as she's inside the barrier,

216
00:12:54,210 --> 00:12:59,320
her physical body will stop growing, 
so she won't gain any magic.

217
00:12:59,670 --> 00:13:05,490
Um, can I tell Kurosawa 
about our meeting, Miss Alice?

218
00:13:05,490 --> 00:13:08,370
Huh? No... Sure...

219
00:13:08,370 --> 00:13:09,560
Which is it?

220
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:13,890
I don't want her to think 
I'm an uncool mom who's clingy!

221
00:13:13,890 --> 00:13:19,160
But I'm sure she's sensed my magic 
and figured out I'm here.

222
00:13:19,160 --> 00:13:22,280
In that case, I guess it should be fine...

223
00:13:22,990 --> 00:13:26,450
Alice, weren't you here today to see me?

224
00:13:27,870 --> 00:13:29,960
Yes! That's right!

225
00:13:29,960 --> 00:13:31,550
Listen up, human.

226
00:13:31,550 --> 00:13:35,050
Feel free to tell my kitty all 
about my visit.

227
00:13:35,050 --> 00:13:36,940
Oh, sure.

228
00:13:36,940 --> 00:13:39,700
<i>What? Is she just a big ol' softy?</i>

229
00:13:41,010 --> 00:13:43,860
It's about time I get going.

230
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:49,660
I'm planning to stay in the area 
for a while, so I'll be back soon.

231
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:51,790
Bye, Lady Shiranui.

232
00:13:51,790 --> 00:13:54,620
Yeah. Stay in touch.

233
00:13:56,850 --> 00:13:59,340
What'd you think of Alice?

234
00:13:59,650 --> 00:14:05,640
I had my reservations, but I'm glad 
to see how much she cares about Kurosawa.

235
00:14:05,640 --> 00:14:08,480
Right? She's a funny one.

236
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:11,560
Especially how she 
doesn't seem to realize it.

237
00:14:13,730 --> 00:14:15,730
Art Room

238
00:14:14,700 --> 00:14:17,880
So it was my mistress...

239
00:14:19,100 --> 00:14:23,950
I knew it was her magic.

240
00:14:24,550 --> 00:14:25,830
Hey, Kurosawa.

241
00:14:26,380 --> 00:14:27,490
Can I ask you something?

242
00:14:29,300 --> 00:14:32,070
Kurosawa, do you want to be human?

243
00:14:32,980 --> 00:14:36,870
If my mistress wills it.

244
00:14:37,620 --> 00:14:39,240
I'm not asking about Miss Alice.

245
00:14:39,240 --> 00:14:42,010
Do <i>you</i> want to be human?

246
00:14:43,080 --> 00:14:44,220
I don't know.

247
00:14:45,330 --> 00:14:50,510
But since I'm... not normal...

248
00:14:50,890 --> 00:14:54,680
What do you think being normal means?

249
00:14:55,950 --> 00:14:58,840
Whatever my mistress wills.

250
00:14:59,740 --> 00:15:02,610
That's what's normal.

251
00:15:03,300 --> 00:15:04,280
Mr. Hitoma.

252
00:15:04,770 --> 00:15:08,720
Do you think colors are necessary?

253
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:10,280
Huh? Colors?

254
00:15:10,780 --> 00:15:16,960
It's normal for everyone else 
to use lots of colors.

255
00:15:18,060 --> 00:15:19,880
My mistress also...

256
00:15:20,570 --> 00:15:23,430
I like your art, Kurosawa.

257
00:15:25,450 --> 00:15:28,670
Your art may lack color, 
but you come through clearly in it.

258
00:15:30,380 --> 00:15:33,530
You and I may see in different colors,

259
00:15:33,530 --> 00:15:35,710
but that difference 
doesn't mean you're wrong.

260
00:15:36,130 --> 00:15:40,860
That's why I don't think colors 
are an absolute must.

261
00:15:44,690 --> 00:15:46,590
I dodged that!

262
00:15:47,360 --> 00:15:49,200
Shiranui High

263
00:15:50,140 --> 00:15:52,270
Yes? This is Hitoma speaking.

264
00:15:52,270 --> 00:15:53,710
<i>Oh, Mr. Hitoma.</i>

265
00:15:53,710 --> 00:15:57,780
<i>Kurosawa attempted an escape 
from the barrier.</i>

266
00:15:57,780 --> 00:15:58,520
What?

267
00:15:58,520 --> 00:16:03,220
<i>Luckily, we caught 
her in time, so she's safe.</i>

268
00:16:03,640 --> 00:16:07,740
<i>Mr. Hitoma, can you come 
to the principal's office now?</i>

269
00:16:08,150 --> 00:16:09,670
I'll be right there.

270
00:16:09,670 --> 00:16:11,480
Principal's Office

271
00:16:13,810 --> 00:16:16,470
Why'd you try to escape?

272
00:16:17,130 --> 00:16:20,770
I wanted to... erase the colors.

273
00:16:21,210 --> 00:16:22,210
Mr. Hitoma.

274
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:27,040
I don't want to become human.

275
00:16:27,040 --> 00:16:30,650
So you broke school rules, 
hoping to be expelled?

276
00:16:31,090 --> 00:16:31,900
Yes.

277
00:16:32,650 --> 00:16:34,340
But why an escape?

278
00:16:34,900 --> 00:16:36,930
Is there somewhere you were trying to go?

279
00:16:37,940 --> 00:16:39,080
Because...

280
00:16:39,780 --> 00:16:43,880
I thought my mistress 
would come and get me.

281
00:16:43,880 --> 00:16:45,300
Miss Alice?

282
00:16:45,730 --> 00:16:46,650
Yes.

283
00:16:47,610 --> 00:16:52,890
Why don't you show 
yourself already, Alice?

284
00:16:52,890 --> 00:16:53,710
What?

285
00:16:56,060 --> 00:16:58,940
Can't keep your mouth shut, tengu?

286
00:16:58,940 --> 00:17:01,730
I can't really blame him this time around.

287
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:03,630
Mistress...

288
00:17:03,630 --> 00:17:08,150
A lowly cat like you has got 
some nerve summoning me here.

289
00:17:08,410 --> 00:17:10,680
So? What will you do?

290
00:17:11,150 --> 00:17:14,700
If you go back with me, your only 
future will be turning into a monster.

291
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:17,240
I studied up.

292
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:18,910
Huh? What?

293
00:17:19,190 --> 00:17:23,690
I studied black magic in search...

294
00:17:24,890 --> 00:17:28,210
of a way to remain in control of myself.

295
00:17:28,680 --> 00:17:31,760
A way to control yourself? 
Did you find one?

296
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:33,840
I found nothing.

297
00:17:34,930 --> 00:17:36,220
So it was pointless.

298
00:17:36,690 --> 00:17:42,560
Still, I... don't want to be human.

299
00:17:42,560 --> 00:17:43,650
So...

300
00:17:44,760 --> 00:17:51,530
I was hoping you would... 
put an end to it all.

301
00:17:52,820 --> 00:17:56,700
What?! Do you realize what you're saying?!

302
00:17:57,370 --> 00:17:58,390
I do.

303
00:17:59,160 --> 00:18:06,500
You rescued me. Raised me. 
Gave me your magic.

304
00:18:07,820 --> 00:18:10,920
And now I'm here.

305
00:18:11,790 --> 00:18:13,090
Which is why...

306
00:18:13,410 --> 00:18:14,280
Alice.

307
00:18:14,810 --> 00:18:17,770
It's your responsibility.

308
00:18:18,220 --> 00:18:19,640
And if I refuse?

309
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:20,640
You can't.

310
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:21,950
Seriously?

311
00:18:21,950 --> 00:18:24,570
Didn't you say you were fine 
with being human?

312
00:18:25,380 --> 00:18:28,690
Mr. Hitoma taught me.

313
00:18:30,650 --> 00:18:35,970
I don't need to abide 
by what you will of me as normal.

314
00:18:36,360 --> 00:18:40,120
You're all I need.

315
00:18:40,750 --> 00:18:43,090
You're all I ever wanted.

316
00:18:43,090 --> 00:18:45,770
Why are you making me do this?

317
00:18:46,170 --> 00:18:50,510
The color black is all I'll ever know.

318
00:18:50,510 --> 00:18:52,670
What? I don't know what that means.

319
00:18:54,470 --> 00:18:58,590
With a little more time, 
I might have figured something out.

320
00:18:58,860 --> 00:19:01,520
So you could deal with it 
if you just had more time?

321
00:19:01,520 --> 00:19:06,470
If I could control her magic, 
and create a suitable vessel to hold it...

322
00:19:06,900 --> 00:19:08,210
Three years, then.

323
00:19:09,020 --> 00:19:10,850
You have three years.

324
00:19:10,850 --> 00:19:13,770
I'll maintain Neneko 
at her current magical level.

325
00:19:13,770 --> 00:19:15,820
Can you figure something out in that time?

326
00:19:15,820 --> 00:19:17,540
I-I can!

327
00:19:17,540 --> 00:19:18,660
Neneko?

328
00:19:19,620 --> 00:19:20,740
Does that mean...

329
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:27,250
I might be able to stay 
with Alice forever?

330
00:19:27,250 --> 00:19:29,790
Yes, if everything goes well.

331
00:19:32,970 --> 00:19:37,520
I... want to stay with Alice.

332
00:19:37,520 --> 00:19:39,890
Then you'll have to work hard.

333
00:19:39,890 --> 00:19:42,280
Lady Shiranui.

334
00:19:42,280 --> 00:19:45,370
How exactly will you stop her 
from gaining magic?

335
00:19:45,370 --> 00:19:46,930
There are two methods.

336
00:19:47,230 --> 00:19:52,290
The first is to lend her my ring, 
and have her learn to control her magic.

337
00:19:52,290 --> 00:19:57,430
The second is to have her live in
the shrine in the forest and learn there.

338
00:19:57,790 --> 00:20:01,590
I suggest the latter, 
since I can lend my support.

339
00:20:02,270 --> 00:20:03,910
The shrine?

340
00:20:04,600 --> 00:20:07,880
Ugh, I don't want to 
be indebted to a tengu!

341
00:20:07,880 --> 00:20:10,010
I would rather not as well.

342
00:20:10,330 --> 00:20:14,210
But since it's Lady Shiranui's proposal, 
I'll go along with it.

343
00:20:14,210 --> 00:20:16,280
So? What do you think?

344
00:20:16,830 --> 00:20:18,710
Fine...

345
00:20:19,670 --> 00:20:22,900
Even if it means being 
beholden to that tengu...

346
00:20:22,900 --> 00:20:23,890
In that case...

347
00:20:29,210 --> 00:20:31,850
Neneko Kurosawa, you are hereby dismissed.

348
00:20:46,690 --> 00:20:49,000
Ugh, this shrine's a mess.

349
00:20:49,300 --> 00:20:53,040
Must you be so rude all the time, Alice?

350
00:20:53,370 --> 00:20:57,170
Can I use magic on this 
building? Is it magic-free?

351
00:20:57,170 --> 00:21:00,590
<i>Why does it sound like 
you're talking about smoking?</i>

352
00:21:01,060 --> 00:21:04,970
Due to the barrier, 
you can't use magic on the building.

353
00:21:04,970 --> 00:21:10,140
Instead, Mr. Hitoma will be 
making visits as a custodian.

354
00:21:11,410 --> 00:21:13,440
Do a good job cleaning this place.

355
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:15,130
Sure thing.

356
00:21:18,630 --> 00:21:21,890
I don't know if I should 
still call you Kurosawa...

357
00:21:22,940 --> 00:21:27,830
But I saw you finished that portrait of me
in the art room a while back.

358
00:21:29,550 --> 00:21:32,450
That drawing's been long complete.

359
00:21:33,460 --> 00:21:38,000
But it seems Kurosawa didn't 
want to put an end to it.

360
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:40,870
Was she fussing over the details?

361
00:21:41,320 --> 00:21:45,050
Or perhaps she took 
a liking to you, Mr. Hitoma.

362
00:21:45,460 --> 00:21:48,830
I guess we'll never know, 
since she's left the school.

363
00:21:56,710 --> 00:21:57,610
Kurosawa.

364
00:21:58,230 --> 00:21:59,190
Thank you.

365
00:23:32,950 --> 00:23:39,920
Next Episode:

366
00:23:32,950 --> 00:23:39,920
The Misanthrope and the Heart's Deepest Desire

